        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "gtj_19g_u2l_A",
        "source_quote": "宋司空景仁孫也。",
        "reading": "恒為宋司空殷景仁之孫。",
        "note": "恒為宋司空殷景仁之孫。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 16,
        "end_codepoint": 24,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:received_sentence1-24",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "gtj_19g_u2l_A",
        "source_quote": "恒及父道矜，竝有古風，以是見蚩於世，其事非一。",
        "reading": "殷道矜為恒父，並有古風，為世所譏。",
        "note": "殷道矜為恒父，並有古風，為世所譏。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 24,
        "end_codepoint": 47,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:received_sentence1-47",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "gtj_19g_u2l_A",
        "source_quote": "恒，宋泰始初，爲度支尚書，坐屬父疾及身疾多，爲有司所奏。",
        "reading": "恒在宋泰始初任度支尚書，以父及本人有疾為有司所奏。",
        "note": "恒在宋泰始初任度支尚書，以父及本人有疾為有司所奏。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinheng:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 47,
        "end_codepoint": 75,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
